; - Modified the Nhvt and Phvt rules to allow integrated body ties
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; VERSION v2.7
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Changes:
; - Recompiled rcx capgen files using Assura version 3.1.4 USR2
; - Added a simple mim capacitor to the PDK
; - Updated the block ICC rules
; - Returned table spacing rules to their original high to low order
; - Updated VLM rules to match AMS Flow Kit data
